WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.240
I want you to think back to who you were

00:03.240 --> 00:06.480
when you started this journey in lesson one.

00:06.480 --> 00:08.640
Think about the intention you set

00:08.640 --> 00:10.960
and the goals you articulated.

00:10.960 --> 00:14.560
Now think about where you are today.

00:14.560 --> 00:16.880
The growth that has happened in a season

00:16.880 --> 00:20.620
of focused conditioning is profound.

00:20.620 --> 00:23.000
The best way to solidify that growth

00:23.000 --> 00:26.080
is to review your game tape.

00:26.080 --> 00:29.000
In your playbook, you'll find the final section

00:29.000 --> 00:31.280
of your 90-Day Way scorecard.

00:31.280 --> 00:35.160
It's your personal post-season review.

00:35.160 --> 00:38.600
It's going to prompt you to identify your biggest wins

00:38.600 --> 00:41.240
and your most significant breakthroughs

00:41.240 --> 00:44.320
across each of the A.R.A.W. pillars.

00:44.320 --> 00:48.320
Don't rush this, be specific.

00:48.320 --> 00:51.040
What was your biggest agility win?

00:51.040 --> 00:54.520
Maybe it was a moment you had to pivot on a project

00:54.520 --> 00:57.060
and you did it with confidence.

00:57.100 --> 01:00.020
When did your resilience shine through?

01:00.020 --> 01:02.700
Think of a specific moment you faced criticism

01:02.700 --> 01:05.140
and instead of getting defensive,

01:05.140 --> 01:08.220
you chose to lean in and be curious.

01:08.220 --> 01:10.980
What was your most important alignment breakthrough?

01:10.980 --> 01:13.860
Was there a tough decision you had to make

01:13.860 --> 01:18.300
and you did it because it didn't align with your M.V.P.?

01:18.300 --> 01:21.460
What was your new wellbeing habit?

01:21.460 --> 01:25.540
And maybe how did that make a difference in your energy?

01:25.540 --> 01:29.580
Taking the time to name these wins is not about ego.

01:29.580 --> 01:32.300
It's about encoding the lessons.

01:32.300 --> 01:35.180
When you consciously acknowledge a breakthrough,

01:35.180 --> 01:36.860
you're telling your brain,

01:36.860 --> 01:40.020
this is a new strategy that works, hello.

01:40.020 --> 01:42.740
This is who I am now.

01:42.740 --> 01:44.100
Let's keep it.

01:44.100 --> 01:46.660
You are solidifying the neural pathways

01:46.660 --> 01:50.100
to becoming the athlete you were always meant to be.

